  "description": "<p>Welcome guests aboard with this personalized nautical doormat, featuring an anchor design and vibrant maritime colors. This unique rug can be customized with your boat name or location, making it a distinctive accent for any marine setting. Crafted for both indoor and outdoor use, it adds a touch of seafaring style to cabins, yachts, or dockside areas.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Customizable with boat name or location for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Features vibrant maritime colors and an anchor design.</li>\n<li>Includes anti-slip pads for secure placement on any surface.</li>\n<li>Designed for easy cleaning and maintenance.</li>\n<li>Suitable for use in various marine and coastal environments.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Cabin, Ship, Dock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Personalized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Anchor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester, Memory Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, or wipe with a damp cloth</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is suitable for enhancing the entrance of cabins, yachts, fishing boats, or any dockside area. It’s also ideal for use in coastal homes, bringing a maritime theme to your living space.</p>",
